const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"综述讨论会计与金融研究中如何把文档转换为文本度量，以及这些选择的验证困难。 阅读时先把它理解为一个被界定的问题，而不是可以脱离样本、时间和制度环境的结论。",en:"“Textual Analysis in Accounting and Finance: A Survey” frames a bounded research question. Read the stated question together with the named sample, dates, and institutional setting rather than treating it as a conclusion that automatically travels to another market or period."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/1475-679x.12123",label:{zh:"Journal of Accounting Research (2016) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Accounting Research (2016) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"来源比较词典、语调、可读性和其他文本特征的构造与验证问题，强调文本对象和测量规则不可分离。 这说明比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系是研究合同的一部分；改变其中任何一项，都可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"For “Textual Analysis in Accounting and Finance: A Survey”, the source describes a deliberate comparison, observation window, and control relation. Those choices are part of its research contract: changing one can change the proposition being tested, even when the method label remains the same."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/1475-679x.12123",label:{zh:"Journal of Accounting Research (2016) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Accounting Research (2016) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"应保存文档原件或允许访问的版本、来源与权限、首次可见时间、实体映射、特征字典和人工验证样本。 数据字段、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原始研究分开记录，不能仅凭同名变量或最终修订数据就视为可比。",en:"For “Textual Analysis in Accounting and Finance: A Survey”, keep the fields, their availability timing, and the sample filters separate from the original study. A same-named variable, later-revised database, or matching end-of-period date is not automatically a comparable input."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/1475-679x.12123",label:{zh:"Journal of Accounting Research (2016) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Accounting Research (2016) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"文本变量是经过选择与处理的度量，不是天然无偏的事实；公开可见也不等同于可再分发或可用于训练。 它支持的是该来源所描述的经验或理论关系；它本身不把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"For “Textual Analysis in Accounting and Finance: A Survey”, the source supports only the empirical or theoretical relation it describes. It does not turn association, model fit, or historical performance into causality, a directly executable procedure, or a guarantee about subsequent outcomes."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/1475-679x.12123",label:{zh:"Journal of Accounting Research (2016) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Accounting Research (2016) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"记录抓取和版本来源，去除转载重复，区分文本发布日期与财报期，并让标签验证与模型训练保持隔离。 在做后续分析前，应把这些选择写入版本化的研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Before extending “Textual Analysis in Accounting and Finance: A Survey”, record its sample, timing, construction choices, and source edition in a versioned note. Keep the primary-source link and access date so a later reader can distinguish a changed definition from a changed result."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/1475-679x.12123",label:{zh:"Journal of Accounting Research (2016) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Accounting Research (2016) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 Journal of Accounting Research (2016)。该综述不证明任何词典或模型在所有语言、行业和时期有效，也不授予文本或新闻的使用权。 若需要量化结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites Journal of Accounting Research (2016) for “Textual Analysis in Accounting and Finance: A Survey”. Its public description defines the boundary. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/1475-679x.12123",label:{zh:"Journal of Accounting Research (2016) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Accounting Research (2016) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Textual Analysis in Accounting and Finance: A Survey”所公开说明的研究问题与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。该综述不证明任何词典或模型在所有语言、行业和时期有效，也不授予文本或新闻的使用权。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Textual Analysis in Accounting and Finance: A Survey”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
